OL,3,C'For the sake of the game': Lisa Nandy
OL,4,Cdemands swfit end to Man City saga
OL,6,FThe Culture Secretary has warned the
OL,7,Freported financial charges against
OL,8,FManchester City are "very, very
OL,9,Fserious", as she pressed Premier
OL,10,FLeague bosses to settle the case "for
OL,11,Fthe sake of the whole game."
OL,13,FITV News understands that City have
OL,14,Fbeen found guilty of more than 100
OL,15,FPremier League rules between 2009 and
OL,16,F2018, which the strongly deny.
OL,18,FMP Lisa Nandy acknowledged that in the
OL,19,F"most extreme case", the club could
OL,20,Fface expulsion from the Premier League
OL,21,Fif found guilty.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790437687
OL,3,C'For the sake of the game': Lisa Nandy
OL,4,Cdemands swfit end to Man City saga
OL,6,FHowever, she stressed that the process
OL,7,Fstill has some way to run, with the
OL,8,Fclub contesting the charges and
OL,9,Fretaining the right to appeal.
OL,11,FAddressing the potential severity of
OL,12,Fsanctions if charges are upheld, she
OL,13,Fsaid: "Obviously in the most extreme
OL,14,Fcase, the penalty that could be
OL,15,Fapplied would be for Manchester City
OL,16,Fto be expelled from the Premier League.
OL,18,F"But we have a long way to run before
OL,19,Fthat. Manchester City are contesting
OL,20,Fthe charges, they've got the right to
OL,21,Fappeal, and that must be heard fairly.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790437687
OL,3,C'For the sake of the game': Lisa Nandy
OL,4,Cdemands swfit end to Man City saga
OL,6,F"But we are urging the Premier League
OL,7,Fto come to a resolution on this as
OL,8,Fquickly as possible for the sake of
OL,9,Fthe whole game."
OL,11,FWith the earliest allegations dating
OL,12,Fback to 2009, the Culture Secrerary
OL,13,Fwarned that the prolonged
OL,14,Finvestigation threatens to undermine
OL,15,Fsupporter trust across English
OL,16,Ffootball.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790437687
OL,3,C'For the sake of the game': Lisa Nandy
OL,4,Cdemands swfit end to Man City saga
OL,6,F"The longer this goes on, the more
OL,7,Fdifficult it is for fans to feel a
OL,8,Flevel of confidence in the game," she
OL,9,Fexplained. "And so we have asked them
OL,10,Fto do everything within their power to
OL,11,Fmake sure that there is a fair and
OL,12,Fswift conclusion."
OL,14,FLisa Nandy confirmed that government
OL,15,Fministers remain in close contact with
OL,16,Fboth the Premier League and individual
OL,17,Fclubs regarding the matter.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790437687
OL,3,C'For the sake of the game': Lisa Nandy
OL,4,Cdemands swfit end to Man City saga
OL,6,FShe added that once the case is
OL,7,Fconcluded, the government will examine
OL,8,Fwhat lessons can be drawn to ensure
OL,9,Ffinancial rules remain clear and
OL,10,Fenforceable.
OL,12,F"English football is one of our great
OL,13,Fsuccess stories, the Premier League in
OL,14,Fparticular," she said. "But the
OL,15,FPremier League rests on a pyramid of
OL,16,Fclubs that go all the way through the
OL,17,FChampionship into the grassroots and
OL,18,Fthe National League that are
OL,19,Fincredibly important.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790437687
OL,3,C'For the sake of the game': Lisa Nandy
OL,4,Cdemands swfit end to Man City saga
OL,6,F"It's why as a government we've taken
OL,7,Fdecisive action to safeguard football
OL,8,Fthrough the introduction of a
OL,9,Fregulator and putting fans back at the
OL,10,Fheart of the game with more powers and
OL,11,Fcontrol over their own clubs."
OL,13,FLisa Nandy insisted that overseas
OL,14,Finvestment remains welcome, pointing
OL,15,Fto her own team, Wigan Athletic, which
OL,16,Fwas previously owned by a Bahraini
OL,17,Ffamily.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790437687
OL,3,C'For the sake of the game': Lisa Nandy
OL,4,Cdemands swfit end to Man City saga
OL,6,F"Foreign investment in English clubs
OL,7,Fis welcome," she stated. "My own club,
OL,8,FWigan Athletic, was bought by a
OL,9,FBahraini family many years ago and we
OL,10,Fwere grateful to them for the
OL,11,Finvestment that they put in.
OL,13,F"But investors, all investors, are
OL,14,Fcustodians of their clubs. They have a
OL,15,Fresponsibility to uphold the integrity
OL,16,Fof the game and to their fans, and to
OL,17,Fhand those clubs over in as good or
OL,18,Fbetter shape than they found them to
OL,19,Fthe next generation, because in the
OL,20,Fend football belongs to its fans."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790437687
OL,3,C'For the sake of the game': Lisa Nandy
OL,4,Cdemands swfit end to Man City saga
OL,6,FShe concluded: "The investment is
OL,7,Fwelcome and the support is welcome,
OL,8,Fbut the integrity of the game cannot
OL,9,Fbe called into question."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
